WEBVTT

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:30.535
We can't forget that.

00:12:30.559 --> 00:12:32.424
And we must do better.

00:12:33.538 --> 00:12:36.643
But right now, what I know
is people are dying.

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:44.378
And we in Huntington deal with people
suffering from substance use disorder

00:12:44.402 --> 00:12:49.410
of every color and every background,
on the streets, every day.

00:12:50.696 --> 00:12:55.323
The job of a first responder:
prevent unnecessary deaths.

00:12:56.252 --> 00:12:57.402
Period.

00:12:58.847 --> 00:12:59.997
So ...